V 영상으로 더 쉽게 촬영할 수 있습니다. 액션 카메라를 사용하지 않을 때는 안전하게 보관할 수도 있죠.\n구성품\nOsmo 백팩 스트랩 마운트 × 1\nOsmo 고정 나사 × 1\n사양\nOsmo 백팩 스트랩 마운트\n무게: 66 g\n크기: 116.89×64.65×51.95 mm (L×W×H)\nOsmo 고정 나사\n무게: 20.7 g\n크기: 55.6×23×13.3 mm (L×W×H)\n호환 제품\nOsmo Nano*\nOsmo 360**\nOsmo Action 6\nOsmo Action 5 Pro\nOsmo Action 4\nOsmo Action 3\nOsmo Action 2\nOsmo Action\n* 별도 판매되는 Osmo 양방향 퀵 릴리즈 어댑터 마운트 필요.\n** Osmo Action 퀵 릴리즈 어댑터 마운트(별도 판매)가 필요합니다.","images":{"thumb":"https://se-cdn.djiits.com/tpc/uploads/spu/cover/c6e069b1df44d2f114b5fb2d573188d6@origin.png","main":["https://se-cdn.djiits.com/tpc/uploads/spu/cover/c6e069b1df44d2f114b5fb2d573188d6@origin.png","https://se-cdn.djiits.com/tpc/uploads/photo/image/5912d4b65c4137f9d24378bf157b3bbc@origin.jpg","https://se-cdn.djiits.com/tpc/uploads/photo/image/26e85a3e7a7c36d0c86a1efea60a3c68@origin.jpg","https://se-cdn.djiits.com/tpc/uploads/photo/image/f8a24189f7bad071d2ad699912e6241e@origin.jpg","https://se-cdn.djiits.com/tpc/uploads/photo/image/78520ba2c1cb6c0d66ff5cd01b291e24@origin.jpg","https://se-cdn.djiits.com/tpc/uploads/photo/image/998ec2737d76c6229b336603c218183b@origin.jpg","https://se-cdn.djiits.com/tpc/uploads/photo/image/f35f3e677a1e18cd824cb71e693a807b@origin.jpg"],"detail":[]},"source_id":"138081"},"avx-2486":{"images":{"thumb":"https://www.avx.co.kr/data/goods/1/2025/09/2486_temp_17580069190020list1.png","main":["https://www.avx.co.kr/data/goods/1/2025/09/2486_temp_17580069190020view.png","https://www.avx.co.kr/data/goods/1/2025/09/2486_temp_17580069209189view.png","https://www.avx.co.kr/data/goods/1/2025/09/2486_temp_17580069203535view.png","https://www.avx.co.kr/data/goods/1/2025/09/2486_temp_17580069216417view.png"],"detail":["https://www.avx.co.kr/data/editor/goods/1/2025/09/2486_3fa88effca8f81741517aa49e0bb615e1617372.png","https://www.avx.co.kr/data/editor/goods/1/2025/09/2486_716370240c8852a0a1df693574b0bc551617372.png","https://www.avx.co.kr/data/editor/goods/1/2025/09/2486_4ac754470588fa92642557e02fcc058b1617372.png"]},"s